===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰel-|id=shiny}}
From {{compound|en|dephlogisticated|t1=from which the phlogiston has been removed|air|notext=1|type=endocentric}}, {{coinage|en|Joseph Priestley|nat=the English|occ=chemist|nobycat=1|nocap=1}} (1733–1804) in a 1775 article entitled “An Account of Further Discoveries in Air” published in the ''{{w|Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society}}'': see the quotation.<ref>Compare {{R:OED Online|subpos=n|subid=7150224|entry=dephlogisticate|pos=v|id=50273|date=September 2022}}</ref>

